 "strings": {
  "You again?\nCan't you handle the rest on your end?": "",
  "I have nothing more to say.\nI've told the police all that I know.": "",
  "I've already told the police\neverything I know.": "",
  "Yeah, I know.\nSorry about all this, Director.": "",
  "Apologies, sir,\nyou're absolutely right, but...": "",
  "Problem is, my partner here won't give\nit a rest 'til he sees the scene of the crime.": "",
  "This guy wants to see the crime scene,\nand he won't take no for an answer.": "",
  "But...\nI'm sure we'll be leaving soon.": "",
  "We won't be long.": "",
  "That's not what we agreed upon.": "",
  "Don't make promises we can't keep.": "",
  "You know this isn't about\nhow long it takes.": "",
  "I'll be here until I'm satisfied.": "",
  "And what about Okubo?\nI take it he's still not fessed up.": "",
  "So Okubo still hasn't admitted to the crime?": "",
  "Uh... No, not quite as of yet, sir.": "",
  "Right, he's really digging his heels in.": "",
  "But we all saw where the body was.\nExactly where he said it would be.": "",
  "The body turned up where\nhe said he buried it and all.": "",
  "Quite true.\nNot much point in fighting this now.": "",
  "Right? Then hurry up\nand put this trial to bed.": "",
  "The minister has made it clear that he wants\nit resolved soon, as well. *sigh*": "",
  "Goddamn, how did a single contractor\nstir up this much trouble?": "",
  "Just look at how much trouble one\ncontractor has caused.": "",
  "The minister wants this cleared up\nas quickly as possible.": "",
  "Sorry... Which minister?": "",
  "By \"the minister...\"": "",
  "I didn't know about this, sir.": "",
  "You mean the Minister of Health?": "",
  "The Health Minister.\nIt's all his call how much funding we get.": "",
  "Obviously. Our budget falls\nunder the Health Ministry.": "",
  "Director. If I may.": "",
  "Um, Director...": "",
  "If you would just direct me to the scene\nof the crime, I could head over there myself.": "",
  "If you could point me in the right direction,\nI'd be happy to examine it myself.": "",
  "I'll be out of your hair in no time,\nI assure you.": "",
  "I'll be discreet.": "",
  "I'd rather you didn't\nwander on your own.": "",
  "I can't let you just wander around.": "",
  "So instead...\nShe can show you.": "",
  "She can be your chaperone.": "",
  "Terasawa-kun. These gentlemen here\nare Shintani-sensei, and...": "",
  "Terasawa-kun.\nThis is Shintani-sensei and...": "",
  "Yagami.": "",
  "It's a pleasure. I hope I can help\nyou find what you need.": "",
  "I'm Terasawa.\nPleased to meet you.": "",
  "Well...\nWith that I'll be taking my leave.": "",
  "I'll take my leave, then.": "",
  "Thank you again, Director.\nApologies for all the trouble.": "",
  "Thank you, Director.\nApologies for the trouble.": "",
  "This way. I can show you how to get\nto Waku-san's room.": "",
  "Well, then...\nShould we start with Waku-san's room?": "",
  "...Who's Waku-san?": "",
  "Waku-san?": "",
  "The guy who died in his room?": "",
  "The victim, remember?": "",
  "Uhhh. Oh yeah.": "",
  "O-Oh, right. Yeah.": "",
  "And you are...": "",
  "And you were...": "",
  "Terasawa-san, huh?": "",
  "Terasawa-san, right?": "",
  " Wooow, you're young.\nAnd a looker to boot.": "",
  "You're so young!\nI didn't catch your first name?": "",
  "Umm...\nCan we keep this professional?": "",
  "Uh, I'm kind of busy here, so...": "",
  "Nice try, Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "Come on, Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "Just now, we went to the ADDC.": "",
  "We went to see the ADDC.　": "",
  "Thought I should have a look\nat things with my own eyes.": "",
  "I wanted to see it with my own eyes.　": "",
  "And? How'd it go?": "",
  "And? What do you think?": "",
  "There's no chance you walk.\nYou're practically a lost cause.": "",
  "We don't stand a chance in hell.　": "",
  "Yagami-sensei is...\nthat what you think?": "",
  "Yagami-sensei, do you agree?": "",
  "It's like this, Okubo. You tell me\nyou're innocent, and I'll fight to the end.": "",
  "If you say you're innocent,\nI'm with you to the end.": "",
  "I really have nothing to\nlose by helping you out.": "",
  "I've got nothing to lose in offering that.　": "",
  "It's just like I told you.": "",
  "I didn't do it!": "",
  "Whoever did it is framing me.": "",
  "Terasawa-san?": "",
  "Okubo-san's not\na violent person.": "",
  "Okubo-san isn't some\nkind of violent criminal.": "",
  "And he hasn't even had a drink in over six years.\nNot a single drop since the incident!": "",
  "He hasn't touched a drop of alcohol\nsince his outburst six years ago.": "",
  "My court will not stand\nfor this commotion.": "",
  "I'm afraid you're out of order.": "",
  "He didn't blame Waku-san at all. He knew that\nthe outburst was just caused by his dementia.": "",
  "He understood Waku-san was only\nlashing out because of his dementia.": "",
  "That it was all the sickness's fault.": "",
  "So it's not like he held it against him!": "",
  "So there was no reason for him\nto resort to murder!": "",
  "There's no way that would\ndrive him to murder!": "",
  "Terasawa-san. Please.": "",
  "Terasawa-san, please.": "",
  "Okubo-san really is\nan incredible, caring person!": "",
  "Okubo-san has lots of positive traits too!": "",
  "Please leave this courtroom at once.": "",
  "Leave this courtroom before\nI have you removed!": "",
  "You're right that he may be hard\nto approach, but he's a kind soul.": "",
  "He's not the most approachable guy,\nbut he works hard...": "",
  "...And he always keeps his promises!": "",
  "And he keeps his promises!": "",
  "Okubo-san's not the only person in this courtroom\nwho would be affected by a guilty verdict, either.": "",
  "If you find him guilty,\nmy life is basically over too.": "",
  "As a matter of fact,\nit would break my heart.": "",
  "That's why he didn't want me to testify.": "",
  "And even through it all...": "",
  "I couldn't even tell\nhis own lawyer...": "",
  "He wanted me to keep this a secret! Not to tell anyone,\nnot even his lawyer, that we were dating!": "",
  "That the two of us\nare seeing each other!": "",
  "Even though he knew he could have ended up in prison,\nmaking sure I was safe was the only thing in the world he cared about!": "",
  "Even though he knew he might go to jail,\nhe was only thinking of my future.": "",
  "That's just who he is!": "",
  "That's the kind of guy he is!": "",
  "But when the prosecution has\nalready decided he's a criminal...": "",
  "So is a prosecutor who\npaints him as some kind of bully...": "",
  "How could he possibly\nbe given a fair trial!?": "",
  "...Really giving him\nthe benefit of the doubt!?": "",
  "Her little outburst wasn't technically admissable,\nbut as the trial dragged on, it hung over the jury like a stone.": "",
  "The trial resumed after that, but I think her\nparting remarks helped sway the verdict.": "",
  "And in the end,\nShinpei Okubo was found not guilty.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo was found innocent.": "",
  "But only a month after his release...": "",
  "But...": "",
  "Everything changed.": "",
  "Not more than a month later...　": "",
  "The same girl who had so bravely\nproclaimed Okubo's innocence...": "",
  "Okubo took it upon himself...": "",
  "...Died by the man's own hand.": "",
  "...To render his own cruel verdict\nfor Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "Hey, what are you—": "",
  "Stop! What are you—": "",
  "Let go! Get off me!": "",
  "No, stop it!　": "",
  "Yagami-kun!": "",
  "Oh shit!": "",
  "Shit!": "",
  "Get back.": "",
  "Stay back.": "",
  "What, why? Let's go!": "",
  "What!? No!": "",
  "Hold on a minute!": "",
  "Hey, hold on!": "",
  "Yagami, you're going down!": "",
  "Yagami... You son of a bitch!": "",
  "Why am I not surprised?": "",
  "So it was you.": "",
  "Shioya.": "",
  "I know how to make\nan entrance, don't I?": "",
  "Ya busted down the front door...": "",
  "It's damn good to see ya, Yagami.": "",
  "You're the real deal, Yagami.": "",
  "A cryin' shame these idiots\nwere so goddamn useless, though.": "",
  "Then you've got this\nscrubfest I call a clan...": "",
  "Guess strength in numbers ain't\nall it's chalked up to be.": "",
  "They couldn't do shit even\nwith strength in numbers!": "",
  "Pansies. You all trying to get your\nfingers chopped off tonight, huh?": "",
  "Boys, how many fingers we\ngonna chop off tonight, huh!?": "",
  "You tried to kidnap Mafuyu.": "",
  "You're the one who\ntried to kidnap Mafuyu?": "",
  "Girls.": "",
  "Go.": "",
  "You should've just told me if you wanted to fight.\nWould've been glad to do it at my place.": "",
  "If all you wanted was to continue our fight,\nyou could have just swung by.": "",
  "What is it you want?": "",
  "What are you after?": "",
  "Well, I've got a little job\nI need done. You boys in?": "",
  "I have a job I wanna ask you to do.": "",
  "What job?": "",
  "A job?": "",
  "I'm not in the business of being refused,\nso I needed to take out an insurance policy.": "",
  "But there's no point in asking\nif you could just refuse it.": "",
  "That's why I decided to give that\ngirlfriend of yours a little ride.": "",
  "I figured the lady might've made\na good bargaining chip. ": "",
  "Fuck off.": "",
  "What a dumbass.": "",
  "We would've done it for next to nothing.\nAlmost no questions asked.": "",
  "If the price was right,\nthere's no job we'd turn down.": "",
  "We're that desperate?": "",
  "Hey, we're not <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> desperate...": "",
  "Damn right.": "",
  "That said...": "",
  "But now this asshole went and hit Mafuyu-chan,\nso we're never gonna help him, no matter what he says.": "",
  "Now that you've laid a hand on Mafuyu-chan,\nyou could never pay us enough.": "",
  "And even if Tak ends up on board,\nI'll still kick your ass.": "",
  "Even if you could buy off Tak,\nI'd still fuckin' pound you.": "",
  "Have a little faith, eh?": "",
  "Give me a little credit...": "",
  "A couple of comedians, huh?": "",
  "What a couple of comedians!": "",
  "Fuck it. Looks like I'm just gonna have to bust\nyour pathetic skulls myself. Easier that way.": "",
  "But I've gotta settle the score,\nor we'll be havin' a pretty dull chat.": "",
  "Yeah?": "",
  "Right?": "",
  "Now go. Break their fucking faces!": "",
  "Alright. Fuck 'em up, boys!": "",
  "What the?": "",
  "Hey. Look who it is.": "",
  "Hey. Isn't that guy in the back...": "",
  "Your ol' buddy Hattori, isn't it?": "",
  "...That journalist, Hattori?": "",
  "Great. And who's the old man?": "",
  "And who's the old guy?": "",
  "Well well. Never thought I'd be\nrunning into him here...": "",
  "Never figured I'd be meeting him here.": "",
  "So.": "",
  "You're the ones from the\nYagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "So you're the Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "That \"old man\" is the person responsible\nfor all 10,000 employees in the Kajihira Group...": "",
  "The old dude is the head of Kajihira Group...\nand its 10,000 employees.": "",
  "Shigeru Kajihira.": "",
  "Chairman Shigeru Kajihira.": "",
  "So he's the guy...": "",
  "For real?": "",
  "You need to lose\nthe attitude, Yagami.": "",
  "Don't get cocky, Yagami.": "",
  "Sorry, I need to take this.": "",
  "Excuse me.\nThis is important.": "",
  "Yes, hello.": "",
  "I see.": "",
  "Yes, you've done excellent work.\nThank you.": "",
  "Yes, well done.\nGoodbye.": "",
  "Just so you're aware...": "",
  "To be upfront with you...": "",
  "The prosecution has made a coordinated effort with law enforcement.\nWe've already submitted a request for the court to issue a warrant.": "",
  "We already requested an arrest warrant\nfor the suspect in the Shintani case.": "",
  "I'm sorry for the call, but that was the\nverification of our request, you see.": "",
  "That call just now was\nthe request being granted.": "",
  "You're still going to arrest me\nafter all this, huh?": "",
  "After all I've told you,\nyou're still going to arrest me?": "",
  "Fortunately, you're not\nthe one under arrest.": "",
  "You're not the one we're going to arrest.": "",
  "I wouldn't celebrate.\nWe're not done with you just yet.": "",
  "But, we do have a little job for you.": "",
  "It's in the interest\nof closing the case.": "",
  "Of course, this is to resolve the case.": "",
  "Listen here, Yagami.": "",
  "Listen close now, Yagami.": "",
  "You know who Shintani's killer was?": "",
  "The one who killed Shintani...": "",
  "It's your old friend. Ayabe.": "",
  "...Was Kamurocho PD's Ayabe.": "",
  "Striations on the recovered bullet...\nAre a perfect match to his firearm.": "",
  "The bullet extracted from his body\nwas shot from Ayabe's gun.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
